            <div class="pr-comment-wrap">
              <h3 class="pr-comment-title js-pr-title">
                ◆Over 400 Premium Nodoguro◆
                Popular for whole grilled, shabu-shabu, and Nodoguro rice cooked in a clay pot.
              </h3>
              <div class="pr-comment">
                <p class="pr-comment__body js-pr-comment-body is-hidden">
                  <span class="pr-comment__option"><span class="pr-comment__first">We would like to inform you that our popular &quot;Dokkuro Course&quot; (featuring whole Dokkuro sashimi) will be discontinued after October 31, 2026.Indulge in a luxurious experience with a minimum of two whol<span class="js-pr-comment-more pr-comment__more-icon is-hidden">...</span><button class="pr-comment__more js-pr-comment-more is-hidden" type="button">Read more</button><span class="pr-comment__over js-pr-comment-over">e fish per person.<br />The grilled Dokkuro and the whole Dokkuro clay pot rice are simply exquisite!<br />For first-timers, we highly recommend our most popular option, the &quot;Goku&quot; Dokkuro Course.<br />Please note that for reservations of seven or more guests, a private room fee of 10% of the total will be applied.<br />Sister store information: &quot;Hanare&quot; offers private rooms (for 4 to 13 guests) just a 4-minute walk away.<br /></span></span></span>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rstdtl-top-kodawari">
              <div class="rstdtl-heading">
                <h3 class="rstdtl-heading__title">
                  Specialities
                </h3>
              </div>
              <div class="rstdtl-top-kodawari__item">
                <div class="js-kodawari-cassete rstdtl-top-kodawari__target rstdtl-top-kodawari__target--l" data-kodawari-id="1">
                  <div class="rstdtl-top-kodawari__contents">
                    <p class="rstdtl-top-kodawari__label rstdtl-top-kodawari__label--food">
                      Food 
                    </p>
                    <div class="rstdtl-top-kodawari__photo"><img alt="Enjoy a variety of courses featuring exquisite Nodoguro (Blackthroat Seaperch) (from JPY 12,200)" src="https://tblg.k-img.com/restaurant/images/Rvw/144966/320x320_square_144966568.jpg" />
                    </div>
                    <p class="rstdtl-top-kodawari__title">
                      Enjoy a variety of courses featuring exquisite Nodoguro (Blackthroat Seaperch) (from JPY 12,200)
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="js-kodawari-cassete rstdtl-top-kodawari__target rstdtl-top-kodawari__target--l" data-kodawari-id="2">
                  <div class="rstdtl-top-kodawari__contents">
                    <p class="rstdtl-top-kodawari__label rstdtl-top-kodawari__label--space">
                      Space
                    </p>
                    <div class="rstdtl-top-kodawari__photo"><img alt="&quot;Private Rooms Perfect for Anniversaries, Celebrations, Entertaining, and Dining&quot;" src="https://tblg.k-img.com/restaurant/images/Rvw/144966/320x320_square_144966564.jpg" />
                    </div>
                    <p class="rstdtl-top-kodawari__title">
                      &quot;Private Rooms Perfect for Anniversaries, Celebrations, Entertaining, and Dining&quot;
                    </p>
